 "notes": "One-way shore dive: in at Rick's Reef about 300 m north-east of the Canyon along the coast, south-west along the shallow reef slope (max 14 m) and out through the Canyon lagoon. Dive-centre descriptions (H2O Divers, Sea Dancer) put Rick's Reef 300 m north of the Canyon and drift south, so the path runs that way; the Rick's Reef entry point is placed from that distance and is approximate. Coastline from OpenStreetMap.",
